+"""Native voice seam: configured custom (plugin) STT/TTS providers, and terminal credential refusals.
+
+The plugins below are ordinary registered ``TranscriptionProvider``/``TTSProvider`` subclasses. A plugin that
+overrides ``*_native_once_v1`` sends its one request through the ``NativeTransport`` the seam hands it: a real httpx
+client whose network bytes are replaced by ``native_voice_support.Wire`` (the same synthetic transport the built-in
+provider tests use), so ``wire.count`` is the number of requests that would have left the process. No provider,
+network or plugin discovery is involved; the profile configuration is the real ``config.yaml`` read at call time.
+
